{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and rewarding but still easy for new players to pick up, this fun and wacky CCG features a tactical combat board! Placing and positioning units in strategic locations adds complexity to your game-plan. Take defensive positions to protect your castle, engage in a reckless all-out assault, or complete unique map objectives to get a leg up on your opponent. Build unique decks from 7 different iconic factions: Vikings, Crusaders, Warlocks, Pirates, Ninjas, Druids, and Undead. Combine up to two factions at once for unique gameplay strategies!<br><br>Cards and Castles ULTIMATE is the third game in the Cards and Castles series, and offers many new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT TABLES!</strong>\u00a0True pass-around drafting in custom lobbies, with no currency gating!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL-COLOR CARDS</strong>! Ultra-powerful cards that boost up specific color combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player <strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAVEYARD</strong> system! Slain or discarded units appear as ghosts behind your Castle. Resurrect the dead, and interact with dead units in unique ways with each color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAP OBJECTIVES</strong>. Each multiplayer map has unique secondary objectives for you to claim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUARDIAN position; protect your Castle with any unit you choose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster, more complex early game. Powerful combos and strategies become available very quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on enemies with the new STOMP ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more deck restrictions on legendary cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greatly reduced usage of RNG and random card generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved user interface!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 350 cards to collect with more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards and ELO scoring for top players.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684810?t=1768357661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684810/b7abb6b1f5f31695dc2e1a13064e0c20506d375f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768357661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684810/d31c7de47d0b51bb859c0a9f97b8bf8938bf2cfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768357661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684810/d31c7de47d0b51bb859c0a9f97b8bf8938bf2cfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768357661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and rewarding but still easy for new players to pick up, this fun and wacky CCG features a tactical combat board! Placing and positioning units in strategic locations adds complexity to your game-plan. Take defensive positions to protect your castle, engage in a reckless all-out assault, or complete unique map objectives to get a leg up on your opponent. Build unique decks from 7 different iconic factions: Vikings, Crusaders, Warlocks, Pirates, Ninjas, Druids, and Undead. Combine up to two factions at once for unique gameplay strategies!<br><br>Cards and Castles ULTIMATE is the third game in the Cards and Castles series, and offers many new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT TABLES!</strong>\u00a0True pass-around drafting in custom lobbies, with no currency gating!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL-COLOR CARDS</strong>! Ultra-powerful cards that boost up specific color combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player <strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAVEYARD</strong> system! Slain or discarded units appear as ghosts behind your Castle. Resurrect the dead, and interact with dead units in unique ways with each color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAP OBJECTIVES</strong>. Each multiplayer map has unique secondary objectives for you to claim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUARDIAN position; protect your Castle with any unit you choose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster, more complex early game. Powerful combos and strategies become available very quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on enemies with the new STOMP ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more deck restrictions on legendary cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greatly reduced usage of RNG and random card generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved user interface!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 350 cards to collect with more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards and ELO scoring for top players.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Red Team Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https:/